    "markdown": "# pandas.Series.dt.days_in_month#\n\n- Series.dt.days_in_month[source]#\n- The number of days in the month. Examples >>> s = pd.Series([\"1/1/2020 10:00:00+00:00\", \"2/1/2020 11:00:00+00:00\"]) >>> s = pd.to_datetime(s) >>> s 0 2020-01-01 10:00:00+00:00 1 2020-02-01 11:00:00+00:00 dtype: datetime64[ns, UTC] >>> s.dt.daysinmonth 0 31 1 29 dtype: int32",
